week 7
-- autoregressive text generation --

-- the program splits sample text into lowercase words
-- it remembers which words appeared after each word
-- generation starts with "the" and randomly picks a next word
-- each chosen word becomes the input for the next prediction
-- generation stops after up to 10 steps or when no next word is found
-- the output can change each time because the next word is chosen randomly

-- what i did

I created a small word-level example of autoregressive generation using a sample text. It uses Python's built-in random module and does not need extra packages.

Files: autoregression.py
